      "detail": "Which combinations of `filteringAction`, `activeContent`, `unscannable`, `passwordProtected`, `operation` and the size fields the API accepts is not stated. The Python SDK passes them as flat arguments with no cross-field validation; the Terraform provider rejects active_content without a supported file type or together with unscannable (zia.file-type-control.criteria:provider-active-content-checks), but that is provider behavior. The contract's passwordProtected note adds a Malware Protection Security Exceptions dependency. Resolves with a lab test of the API directly.",
